#: ../../dart/user_guide/tutorials/collisions.md:93
#: 9518619acdf14836acb43e7d7c636871
msgid ""
"An ``Eigen::Isometry3d`` is the Eigen library's version of a homogeneous "
"transformation matrix. Here we are initializing it to an Identity matrix "
"to start out. This is almost always something you should do when creating"
" an Eigen::Isometry3d, because otherwise its contents will be completely "
"arbitrary trash."
msgstr ""
"``Eigen::Isometry3d`` 는 Eigen 라이브러리의 동차 변환 행렬입니다. 여기서는 단위 행렬로 초기화합니다. "
"Eigen::Isometry3d를 생성할 때는 대부분 이렇게 초기화해야 합니다. 그렇지 않으면 행렬에 임의의 값이 들어 있습니다."

#: ../../dart/user_guide/tutorials/collisions.md:99
#: a62327af337a48f4a420621bc0a56ed5
